Hello,

First of all, I would like to thank you for setting up  this package
and also the forum.

I just started to work on aroma.affymetrix. I am using this cdf file
"HuEx-1_0-st-v2,full,A20071112,EP.cdf" and FIRMA fit model to analyse
the possible alternative splicing effect of an RNA-binding protein
using 6 Human Exon arrats from Affymetrix. They are all from the same
chip type( HuEx-1_0-st-v2 ). The arrays are corresponding to 3 type:
1- control:    array 1,2  (replicates)
2- siRNA_A array  3,4 (replicates)
